title: "Vision-guided kitting with a bimanual OpenArm 2.0"
abstract: >-
  Vision-guided kitting with a bimanual OpenArm 2.0 on ROS 2 Jazzy: part detection, classification and pose
  estimation from an RGB-D camera, grasp selection and pick and place planned with MoveIt Task Constructor,
  executed on mock hardware or in NVIDIA Isaac Sim.
